# ── Docker / secrets (added for the container package) ──────────────────────────
# .env* above also matches the template; keep it tracked
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
.env.*
*.env.bak*
*.bak
*.bak-*
.env.sample
# token / key material: never commit (mounted into containers at run time instead)
